From {{inh|en|enm|eclipse}}, from {{der|en|fro|eclipse}}, from {{der|en|la|eclīpsis}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἔκλειψις|t=eclipse}}, from {{m|grc|ἐκλείπω|t=to abandon, go missing, vanish}}, from {{m|grc|ἐκ|t=out}} and {{m|grc|λείπω|t=to leave behind}}. {{doublet|en|eclipsis}}. See also {{m|en|ellipse}}, {{m|en|ellipsis}}.

